[{:db/id "f99bc2f0-dc2e-52dc-9a0f-88e468f57bb1" :answer/id #uuid "f99bc2f0-dc2e-52dc-9a0f-88e468f57bb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{12}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e512f17f-c103-5c3c-82bb-5f6973f5c51f" :answer-field/id #uuid "e512f17f-c103-5c3c-82bb-5f6973f5c51f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["f99bc2f0-dc2e-52dc-9a0f-88e468f57bb1"] :answer-field/correct "f99bc2f0-dc2e-52dc-9a0f-88e468f57bb1" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "99a60241-72e6-5737-aea9-72c487d2682d" :question/id #uuid "99a60241-72e6-5737-aea9-72c487d2682d" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=3x-6\\sqrt{x}$ at the point $(25,45).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3x-6\\sqrt{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3x-6{x}^{1/2}) \\\\  & =3-6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2} \\\\  & =3-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=25$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25} & =3-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =3-\\frac{3}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(25,45)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25}=\\frac{12}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["e512f17f-c103-5c3c-82bb-5f6973f5c51f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224" :answer/id #uuid "d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{18}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "582b05a9-721f-55c9-8b5f-c6b352f58f5e" :answer-field/id #uuid "582b05a9-721f-55c9-8b5f-c6b352f58f5e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224"] :answer-field/correct "d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7526651e-3bb1-5a8c-b6a7-9e835e617845" :question/id #uuid "7526651e-3bb1-5a8c-b6a7-9e835e617845" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=4x-4\\sqrt{x}$ at the point $(25,80).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x-4\\sqrt{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x-4{x}^{1/2}) \\\\  & =4-4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2} \\\\  & =4-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=25$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25} & =4-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =4-\\frac{2}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{18}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(25,80)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25}=\\frac{18}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["582b05a9-721f-55c9-8b5f-c6b352f58f5e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d976be9a-c383-55b4-8fa3-19e15b20df98" :answer/id #uuid "d976be9a-c383-55b4-8fa3-19e15b20df98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{44}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6730e01e-de66-5eea-bfc8-6c0da58cc651" :answer-field/id #uuid "6730e01e-de66-5eea-bfc8-6c0da58cc651" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["d976be9a-c383-55b4-8fa3-19e15b20df98"] :answer-field/correct "d976be9a-c383-55b4-8fa3-19e15b20df98" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "08e2c497-48ce-5260-bb75-340ad4b7ea14" :question/id #uuid "08e2c497-48ce-5260-bb75-340ad4b7ea14" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=9x-2\\sqrt{x}$ at the point $(25,215).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9x-2\\sqrt{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9x-2{x}^{1/2}) \\\\  & =9-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2} \\\\  & =9-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=25$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25} & =9-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =9-\\frac{1}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{44}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(25,215)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25}=\\frac{44}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["6730e01e-de66-5eea-bfc8-6c0da58cc651"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "aacfe591-5179-533b-a4db-353ac1025958" :answer/id #uuid "aacfe591-5179-533b-a4db-353ac1025958" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{11}{8}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ef8bb82f-c22d-5cef-a814-8ca96adebf89" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef8bb82f-c22d-5cef-a814-8ca96adebf89" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["aacfe591-5179-533b-a4db-353ac1025958"] :answer-field/correct "aacfe591-5179-533b-a4db-353ac1025958" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a7b32659-efdb-5f24-a94b-157e0fbb1fed" :question/id #uuid "a7b32659-efdb-5f24-a94b-157e0fbb1fed" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=4\\sqrt{x}-8{x}^{3/4}$ at the point $(256,-448).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\sqrt{x}-8{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{1/2}-8{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2}-8\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}{x}^{-1/4} \\\\  & =2{x}^{-1/2}-6{x}^{-1/4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=256$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=256} & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{16}-6\\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{11}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(256,-448)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=256}=-\\frac{11}{8}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["ef8bb82f-c22d-5cef-a814-8ca96adebf89"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "df72c75e-38d9-59fd-95c6-a6a89557fe6e" :answer/id #uuid "df72c75e-38d9-59fd-95c6-a6a89557fe6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{32}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "70fb7748-33e1-502e-9aea-e98de3cc4b31" :answer-field/id #uuid "70fb7748-33e1-502e-9aea-e98de3cc4b31" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["df72c75e-38d9-59fd-95c6-a6a89557fe6e"] :answer-field/correct "df72c75e-38d9-59fd-95c6-a6a89557fe6e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "88fecdbc-7bc6-55ea-9ea8-19f24b070e65" :question/id #uuid "88fecdbc-7bc6-55ea-9ea8-19f24b070e65" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=9\\sqrt{x}-2{x}^{3/4}$ at the point $(256,16).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9\\sqrt{x}-2{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9{x}^{1/2}-2{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =9\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2}-2\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}{x}^{-1/4} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}{x}^{-1/2}-\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{-1/4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=256$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=256} & =\\frac{9}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{16}-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{32}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(256,16)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=256}=-\\frac{3}{32}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["70fb7748-33e1-502e-9aea-e98de3cc4b31"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "a32ff939-77c4-521a-a83a-e54ec25d64f3" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186064343.py"} [:db/add 17592186064343 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186064343 :knowledge-point/questions ["99a60241-72e6-5737-aea9-72c487d2682d" "7526651e-3bb1-5a8c-b6a7-9e835e617845" "08e2c497-48ce-5260-bb75-340ad4b7ea14" "a7b32659-efdb-5f24-a94b-157e0fbb1fed" "88fecdbc-7bc6-55ea-9ea8-19f24b070e65"]} [:db/ensure 17592186064343 :knowledge-point/validate]]
